  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2090_staff_01",
      "hash64": "C4F4EF63999FC327",
      "text": "要申請參加校園最強大賽嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2090_staff_02",
      "hash64": "C4F4F063999FC4DA",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是冠軍級的\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，對吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2090_staff_03",
      "hash64": "C4F4F163999FC68D",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的參賽手續完成了。\\n請前往會場。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_00",
      "hash64": "835D61A437E8925A",
      "text": "本屆也拉開序幕了，\\n激鬥校園大戰！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_01",
      "hash64": "835D62A437E8940D",
      "text": "那麼，馬上進入第一回合！\\n令人矚目的對戰者是……！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_02",
      "hash64": "835D5FA437E88EF4",
      "text": "接下來是第二回合！\\n令人好奇的配對是……！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_03",
      "hash64": "835D60A437E890A7",
      "text": "終於進入第三回合了！\\n還剩下４位訓練家！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_04",
      "hash64": "835D5DA437E88B8E",
      "text": "現在只剩下\\n最後一場比賽了……\\c\\n爭奪校園最強之名的\\n最後兩位訓練家就是他們！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_intro_00",
      "hash64": "97756563206B2279",
      "text": "冠軍[VAR 0x0100(0000)]ＶＳ……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_intro_01",
      "hash64": "97756463206B20C6",
      "text": "……２－Ｇ，\\n秘傳廚師――派帕！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_intro_02",
      "hash64": "97756363206B1F13",
      "text": "……１－Ｄ，\\n流星駭客――牡丹！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_intro_03",
      "hash64": "97756263206B1D60",
      "text": "……對戰學老師，\\n熱血沸騰――凰檗！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_intro_04",
      "hash64": "97756963206B2945",
      "text": "……數學老師，\\n勝率計算士――泰姆！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_intro_05",
      "hash64": "97756863206B2792",
      "text": "……歷史老師，\\n古之探究者――蕾荷！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_intro_06",
      "hash64": "97756763206B25DF",
      "text": "……學校的護理師，\\n醫務室天使――米莫莎！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_intro_07",
      "hash64": "97756663206B242C",
      "text": "……家政老師，\\n面惡心善居家型――薩瓦羅！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_intro_08",
      "hash64": "97756D63206B3011",
      "text": "……生物老師，\\n和緩系男子――吉尼亞！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_intro_09",
      "hash64": "97756C63206B2E5E",
      "text": "……語言學老師，\\n溝通專家――賽吉！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_intro_10",
      "hash64": "9771DF63206808F0",
      "text": "……最強學生會長，\\n冠軍――妮莫！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_intro_11",
      "hash64": "9771E06320680AA3",
      "text": "……學院校長，\\n溫文儒雅的克拉韋爾！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_intro_12",
      "hash64": "9771E16320680C56",
      "text": "……美術老師，\\n巨龍咆哮吧――八朔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sub_012_announce_intro_13",
      "hash64": "9771E26320680E09",
      "text": "……學院理事長＆首席冠軍\\n――也慈！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_01_01",
      "hash64": "EB3B7AECC59255DD",
      "text": "呃，是[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳啊！\\n就算很渺茫，但我會抓住獲勝良機的！[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_01_02",
      "hash64": "EB3B77ECC59250C4",
      "text": "呿，碰上[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳這個對手，\\n我真是個倒楣派。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_02_01",
      "hash64": "9206BAD37E412F6A",
      "text": "就、就算對手是[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳，\\n人家也會用布布們打得[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳落花流水……！[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_02_02",
      "hash64": "9206B9D37E412DB7",
      "text": "果然[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳很強……\\n但人家總覺得以[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳為傲。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_03_01",
      "hash64": "E86C66DB19AABCDF",
      "text": "打倒轉學生！\\n我們可以說是不相上下！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_03_02",
      "hash64": "E86C67DB19AABE92",
      "text": "雖然不甘心，但我輸了！\\n接下來的對戰也祝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好運！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_04_01",
      "hash64": "1A117704D2E3CAC4",
      "text": "哎呀，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。\\n請手下留情喔。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_04_02",
      "hash64": "1A117A04D2E3CFDD",
      "text": "我真希望是在我全盛期時和[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳對戰。\\n那麼[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳繼續加油喔。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_05_01",
      "hash64": "EF2663101BEF8699",
      "text": "就讓我來解讀\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳一路累積而成的力量。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_05_02",
      "hash64": "EF2660101BEF8180",
      "text": "敗者只有下台一鞠躬。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要踩著別人登上王座啊。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_06_01",
      "hash64": "95F1A2F6D49E6026",
      "text": "我的稱號實在太俗氣了吧……？\\n算了！我就讓[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳看看什麼是天堂～！[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_06_02",
      "hash64": "95F1A1F6D49E5E73",
      "text": "要是受傷了，我會幫忙治療的。\\n接下來要繼續加油喔～[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_07_01",
      "hash64": "C3ABAEFD377A0DBB",
      "text": "對手是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的話，無可挑剔。\\n就讓我發揮本事了。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_07_02",
      "hash64": "C3ABAFFD377A0F6E",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的強大我甘拜下風。\\n我必須說[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳真不愧是冠軍。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
